tb.found = That's the move I had in mind.
tb.found.2 = Exactly, that's the one.
# Levels 4-6, once per game: the level's takebacks are used up, so no offer this time (said
# where the offer would have been).
tb.none_left = No more takebacks this game, I'm afraid.
tb.none_left.2 = You have no takebacks left in this game.

# ---- Trying the critical position again (levels 1-3) --------------------------------------------------
# The end card's "Try that position again": the board is set to the position before the game's biggest
# mistake and the player looks for a better move. The task is followed by ex.hint (the piece that has
# the better move). {best} is the better move; the coach traces it on the board.
retry.task.b1 = Let's go back to that moment. Can you find a better move?
retry.task.b1.2 = Here is the position again. Can you find a better move?
retry.task.b2 = This is the position before your big mistake. Find a better move.
retry.task.b2.2 = Let's look at that moment again. What would you play instead?
retry.task.b3 = This is the position before the critical move. Find the better move.
retry.task.b3.2 = Back to the critical moment. What is the better move?
# A move that is no good: it is taken back, and the player looks again.
retry.again.b1 = Not that one. Have another look.
retry.again.b1.2 = That is not it yet. Try again.
retry.again.b2 = Not that one. Look at the whole board.
retry.again.b2.2 = Not yet. Try another move.
retry.again.b3 = Not that one. Look at what my reply would do.
retry.again.b3.2 = Still not it. Think about my best reply.
# The player found a move that is no mistake (said when the review itself said nothing).
retry.found.b1 = Yes! That is the better move. Well done!
retry.found.b1.2 = You found it! That is much better.
retry.found.b2 = Yes, that works. Well done.
retry.found.b2.2 = That's the idea. Good job.
retry.found.b3 = Correct, that holds up. Well done.
retry.found.b3.2 = That's it. Good find.
# The second miss: the coach shows the better move.
retry.reveal.b1 = Here is the better move: {best}. Watch it.
retry.reveal.b1.2 = Let me show you: {best} was better.
retry.reveal.b2 = The better move was {best}. Look.
retry.reveal.b2.2 = Here it is: {best}.
retry.reveal.b3 = The better move was {best}.
retry.reveal.b3.2 = {best} was the move.
